OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as human poo and
OL,4,Amaggot-infested food left behind at
OL,5,Abeauty spot
OL,6,
OL,7,FHuman poo, food covered in maggots and
OL,8,Fa tent "full of kit" were left behind
OL,9,Fat a south Wales national park over the
OL,10,Fbank holiday weekend.
OL,12,FBannau Brycheiniog National Park said
OL,13,Fthere was "no justification" for
OL,14,Ffly-tipping after noticing a "change in
OL,15,Fattitude" among visitors to its beauty
OL,16,Fspots, leading to an increase in litter
OL,17,Fdumping.
OL,19,F"Unfortunately, across this summer,
OL,20,Fit's not been unusual," the national
OL,21,Fpark authority said.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
